<v Ira        Glass>今天的节目由亚历克斯·布隆伯格和我本人制作，参与者有布鲁·切维尼、乔纳森·戈德斯坦、斯塔莉·凯恩、朱莉·斯奈德和艾琳·扬克。我们的技术总监是马特·蒂尔尼。今天节目的制作由BA帕克完成。

00:58:39.570 --> 00:58:59.650
<v Ira        Glass>Quick program note, a couple weeks ago, we had an excerpt from Jon Ronson's new podcast, The Butterfly Effect, on our program. He has been one of my favorite interviewers anywhere, a wonderful writer. And his podcast has just been released. If you want to hear it, it's an audible.com/butterfly. Our website, ThisAmericanLife.org.
<v Ira        Glass>快速节目预告，几周前，我们在节目中播出了乔恩·罗森的新播客《蝴蝶效应》的节选。他是但我最喜欢的采访者之一，是一位出色的作家。他的播客刚刚发布。如果你想听，地址是audible.com/butterfly。我们的网站是ThisAmericanLife.org。

00:58:59.650 --> 00:59:15.930
<v Ira        Glass>This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks as always to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He still asks me after every single show, you tell them how much it cost? You tell them how long I had to work to buy that? You did not.
<v Ira        Glass>《美国生活》由PRX（公共广播交换台）分发给公共广播电台。一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生。他仍然在每一场演出后问我，你告诉他们那花了多少钱吗？你告诉他们我得工作多久才能买下它吗？你根本没说。

00:59:15.930 --> 00:59:58.740
<v Ira        Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira        Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周回到《美国生活》，带来更多的故事。

